cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this textbook, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Cybersecurity: Theory, Practice, and Ethics"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source cybersecurity textbook for university courses and professional
  certification preparation, covering foundations, cryptography, networking, offensive
  and defensive security, digital forensics, incident response, governance, privacy
  and law, and emerging topics. Layered for learners from high school through
  postdoctoral level and mapped to the CISSP, CompTIA Security+, CEH, CISA, and CGRC
  certification domains.
